          "type": "code",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<!-- Inicio del rediseño: portada mayorista, datos del local y accesos por rubro y talle. -->\n<style>\n  .pm-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:36px 0 20px;color:#1B2340}\n  .pm-eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#168A5E;margin-bottom:10px}\n  .pm-hero h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 14px;font-weight:800}\n  .pm-hero h2 mark{background:#FFC21A;color:#1B2340;padding:0 .15em;border-radius:8px}\n  .pm-lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#5B6480;margin:0 0 20px;max-width:34em}\n  .pm-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px}\n  .pm-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none!important;font-size:15px}\n  .pm-btn.sun{background:#FFC21A;color:#1B2340}.pm-btn.ghost{background:#fff;color:#1B2340;border:1px solid #E1E5EE}\n  .pm-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;font-size:14px;color:#5B6480}.pm-trust b{color:#1B2340}.pm-stars{color:#FFC21A;letter-spacing:1px;margin-right:4px}\n  .pm-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E1E5EE;border-radius:18px;padding:18px}\n  .pm-tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin:8px 0 14px}\n  .pm-tile{display:block;padding:14px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1B2340!important;text-decoration:none!important;font-size:15px}\n  .pm-tile small{display:block;font-weight:500;color:#5B6480;font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}\n  .pm-talles{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .pm-talles a{padding:7px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid #E1E5EE;background:#F7F8FB;color:#1B2340!important;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none!important}\n  .pm-info{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin:8px 0 12px}\n  .pm-info div{background:#fff;border:1px solid #E1E5EE;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;font-size:13px;color:#5B6480}\n  .pm-info b{display:block;color:#1B2340;font-size:14px}\n  @media (max-width:820px){.pm-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:20px}.pm-info{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"pm-hero\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"pm-eyebrow\">Mayorista en Rosario · Para comercios y revendedores</div>\n    <h2>Abastecé tu negocio a <mark>precio mayorista</mark>.</h2>\n    <p class=\"pm-lead\">Pañales, perfumería, cuidado personal y más. Pedido mínimo $50.000 combinando marcas y talles. Retirás en Garay 1249 o te lo enviamos.</p>\n    <div class=\"pm-cta\">\n      <a class=\"pm-btn sun\" href=\"/productos/\">Armar pedido →</a>\n      <a class=\"pm-btn ghost\" href=\"#como-comprar\">Cómo comprar</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pm-trust\"><span><span class=\"pm-stars\">★★★★★</span><b>4,9</b> · 502 opiniones en Google</span><span><b>Retiro</b> en el día</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <aside class=\"pm-card\">\n    <div class=\"pm-eyebrow\">Comprá por rubro</div>\n    <div class=\"pm-tiles\">\n      <a class=\"pm-tile\" style=\"background:#E4EEFF\" href=\"/search/?q=pa%C3%B1al\">Pañales<small>Bebé y adulto</small></a>\n      <a class=\"pm-tile\" style=\"background:#E3F4EE\" href=\"/search/?q=toallas\">Toallitas<small>Húmedas y cambio</small></a>\n      <a class=\"pm-tile\" style=\"background:#FCE6EE\" href=\"/search/?q=colonia\">Perfumería<small>Colonias y post baño</small></a>\n      <a class=\"pm-tile\" style=\"background:#FFF0DA\" href=\"/search/?q=mamadera\">Alimentación<small>Mamaderas y lactancia</small></a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pm-eyebrow\">Pañales por talle</div>\n    <div class=\"pm-talles\">\n      <a href=\"/search/?q=RN\">RN</a><a href=\"/search/?q=pa%C3%B1al%20P\">P</a><a href=\"/search/?q=pa%C3%B1al%20M\">M</a><a href=\"/search/?q=pa%C3%B1al%20G\">G</a><a href=\"/search/?q=pa%C3%B1al%20XG\">XG</a><a href=\"/search/?q=pa%C3%B1al%20XXG\">XXG</a><a href=\"/search/?q=pants\">Pants</a>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</section>\n<div class=\"pm-info\">\n  <div><b>Garay 1249</b>Entre Entre Ríos y Mitre</div>\n  <div><b>Lun a vie 8–16 h</b>Sábados 9–13 h</div>\n  <div><b>Retiro o envío</b>Rosario a coordinar · resto por expreso</div>\n  <div><b>Efectivo</b>Transferencia +5%</div>\n</div>\n",
            "width": "fill"
